{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1551321-koschei-the-deathless-build","id":1551321,"title":"Koschei the deathless build","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-05-27T19:28:36-07:00","id":1551321,"title":"Koschei the deathless build","content":"So, I'm new to scion, but have a build in mind but i don't know what would be the best way to go about it. You see, I'm going to be the groups research/information on the occult guy, and i wanted to base this character off Koschei the Deathless from Slavic folklore. My question is how to do it. Would running a sorcerer be good enough with the basing off him, or would a scion with the magic purview be better? I don't want to be the weak link of the party, even if my role is more not standard combat. This is my first game of this and the gm hasn't run this before either. any help would be appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28836-general-gratas","name":"General gratas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-28T03:05:09-07:00","id":1551323,"title":"","content":"Koschei is a powerful wizard and a total smuck. He looks like a poorly animated corpse. The women he kidnaps routinely beat him up and imprison him. So you'd need to design someone scary powerful and totally incompetent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-28T05:57:53-07:00","id":1551327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1551321-koschei-the-deathless-build?p=1551323#post1551323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Koschei is a powerful wizard and a total smuck. He looks like a poorly animated corpse. The women he kidnaps routinely beat him up and imprison him. So you'd need to design someone scary powerful and totally incompetent.</div> </div> </div> </div> I should clarify, when I say Koschei the deathless type character, I'm more referring to his power set than then entire character. I've made the personality in mind, I just wanted to know how to mechanically build him. Sidenote: Slavic women are no joke, and the only one I remember imprisoning him is Maya, who is a warrior. this may be because it's been a while since I fully deep dived on him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28836-general-gratas","name":"General gratas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-05-28T07:42:02-07:00","id":1551329,"title":"","content":"Koschei seems, by description, to be Lich. An animated corpse controlled by the mind of the body's original owner. As a Lich is a corpse, thus already dead, it can't be killed. Destroyed, possibly, but the dead can't die. <br /> <br /> You'd need to figure out what undeath means in your game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}